  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• Slice zucchini and capsicum into thin sticks.\n• Trim green beans and baby broccoli.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, add a good drizzle of olive oil, garlic and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), then season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340161f7d5496ac4a5fe15/step-b8b68b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic and chilli oil to the tofu and turn to coat. Transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340161f7d5496ac4a5fe15/step-1de8c110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is resting, wipe out frying pan, then return to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Stir-fry capsicum, green beans, zucchini and baby broccoli until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add ginger paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the soy sauce and honey and cook until bubbling, 30 seconds. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340161f7d5496ac4a5fe15/step-4d59ba20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide tofu and ginger-soy veggies between plates. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340161f7d5496ac4a5fe15/step-83ce3f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
